ent of costs associated with healthcare services, ensuring that resources are utilized effectively to enhance the overall efficiency of healthcare delivery.", "MALNUTRICIÓN CALÓRICO-PROTEICA MODERADA:Malnutrición calórico-proteica moderada refers to a moderate level of malnutrition characterized by deficiencies in caloric and protein intake.", "MALNUTRICIÓN CALÓRICO-PROTEICA LEVE:Malnutrición calórico-proteica leve indicates a mild form of malnutrition where there are slight deficiencies in caloric and protein consumption.", "MALNUTRICIÓN CALÓRICO-PROTEICA NO ESPECIFICADA:Malnutrición calórico-proteica no especificada refers to a form of malnutrition that is not clearly defined but involves a lack of both calories and proteins.", "INTRODUCCIÓN EN VENA PERIFÉRICA:Introducción en vena periférica de sustancia nutricional is a medical procedure for delivering nutritional substances directly into the peripheral veins of patients.", "INTRODUCCIÓN EN VENA CENTRAL:Introducción en vena central de sustancia nutricional is a procedure for administering nutritional substances directly into the central veins of patients.", "INTRODUCCIÓN EN BOCA Y FARINGE:Introducción en boca y faringe de sustancia nutricional is a method of delivering nutrition through the mouth and throat, typically for patients who can swallow.", "INTRODUCCIÓN EN GASTROINTESTINAL SUPERIOR:Introducción en gastrointestinal superior de sustancia nutricional is a procedure for delivering nutrition directly into the upper gastrointestinal tract.", "INTRODUCCIÓN EN GASTROINTESTINAL INFERIOR:Introducción en gastrointestinal inferior de sustancia nutricional is a method for administering nutrition directly into the lower gastrointestinal tract.", "INSERCIÓN EN VENA CAVA SUPERIOR:Inserción en vena cava superior de dispositivo de infusión is a medical procedure for placing an infusion device into the superior vena cava for nutritional support.", "INSERCIÓN EN ESTÓMAGO:Inserción en estómago de dispositivo de alimentación is a procedure for placing a feeding device directly into the stomach for nutritional delivery."], "parameters": {"model": "text-embedding-3-small", "temperature": 0.0, "frequency_penalty": null, "presence_penalty": null, "top_p": 1.0, "max_tokens": 4000, "n": 1}, "history": null}